    "created_at": "2015-09-15T08:33:39Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-09-15T08:33:39Z",
    "body": "This may be a spec bug, because it uses the style `position:fixed !important`. @upsuper, this issue looks related to https://github.com/whatwg/fullscreen/issues/19, perhaps you have some ideas?\n",
