    "created_at": "2015-09-17T02:22:33Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-09-17T02:22:33Z",
    "body": "If it is really desired to have viewport scrollbar available for `<dialog>`, I suggest the spec say something like, if the `fullscreenElement` is not null, and it is not the root element, hide the viewport scrollbar. Then we can fix this bug and close #19.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
